src/data/menu-commands.json lists Illustrator executeMenuCommand names and
their menu locations, and src/data/tools.json lists app.selectTool tool ids,
compiled from:

  AiCommandPalette, data/menu_commands.csv
  https://github.com/joshbduncan/AiCommandPalette
  Copyright (c) 2022 Josh Duncan. MIT licence.

  AiMenuObject, AiMenu_v23.jsxinc
  https://github.com/ten-A/AiMenuObject
  Copyright (c) 2019 Ten Agata. MIT licence.

src/tools/path-edit.js plays Simplify and the Pathfinder compound shape
commands as generated Actions, with the event names and parameter codes
recorded in:

  Extend_Script_experimentals, simplify.jsx
  https://github.com/ten-A/Extend_Script_experimentals
  Ten Agata. MIT licence.

  Greyprint, Illustrator/Greyprint Actions.aia
  https://github.com/bjango/Greyprint

  AiSmartPathfinderPalette, jsx/fx/AiSmartPathfinderPalette.jsx
  https://github.com/swwwitch/illustrator-scripts
  Masahiro Takano (@swwwitch).

src/blend.js writes Blend Options as a generated Action, in the format and
with the parameter codes used by:

  BlendSp, jsx/blend/BlendSp.jsx
  https://github.com/swwwitch/illustrator-scripts
  Masahiro Takano (@swwwitch). MIT licence.

src/tools/actions.js lists the loaded action sets from the preference keys
(plugin/Action/SavedSets) that AiCommandPalette reads in src/user/actions.ts.

src/tools/three_d.js writes the 3D and Materials effect with the parameters
Illustrator stores for it, as read back and re-applied by:

  illustrator-com-skill, presets/effects.json
  https://github.com/Moksa1123/illustrator-com-skill
  Copyright (c) 2026 Moksa1123. MIT licence.

and the classic 3D effect in the format and with the parameters used by:

  Live Effect Functions for Illustrator, scripts/LE_Functions.js (LE_3DEffect)
  https://github.com/mark1bean/live-effect-functions-for-illustrator
  Copyright (c) 2021 Mark Bean. MIT licence.

src/tools/brushes.js brings brushes in from a library file the way it is done by:

  ImportAndApplyBrush, jsx/fx/single-function/ImportAndApplyBrush.jsx
  https://github.com/swwwitch/illustrator-scripts
  Masahiro Takano (@swwwitch). MIT licence.

src/flatten.js writes Flatten Transparency as a generated Action, with
the event and parameter codes recorded in:

  FlattenOpacityPro, jsx/color/FlattenOpacityPro.jsx
  https://github.com/swwwitch/illustrator-scripts
  Masahiro Takano (@swwwitch). MIT licence.

  AI_PS_Library, libraries/AI_PS_Library.js
  https://github.com/alexander-ladygin/illustrator-scripts
  Copyright (c) 2018 Alexander Ladygin. MIT licence.

